  "html": "<p>Two-Handed Ranger weapons fall into two basic types; Crossbows or Guns.\nAs the types imply, they are ranged weapons that throw projectiles at the target.<br/><br/>\n</p><p><small>This list is sortable. Click the button next to the heading you wish to sort by. A 2 column sort is also possible, by first sorting one column then the second. </small>\n</p>\n<table border=\"2\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"sortable\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"unsortable\">Icon\n</th><th>Name\n</th><th>Handedness\n</th><th>Type\n</th><th>Speed\n</th><th class=\"unsortable\">Comment\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2h-ranged-_BFG_9001.png\" title=\"Image: 2h-ranged-_BFG_9001.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 2h-ranged-_BFG_9001.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"128\" src=\"/images/recovered/2h-ranged-_BFG_9001.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/BFG_9001\" title=\"BFG 9001\">BFG 9001</a>\n</td><td>Two-Handed Ranged\n</td><td>Slashing\n</td><td>Slothful\n</td><td>\u00a0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2h-ranged-_Shotgun.png\" title=\"Image: 2h-ranged-_Shotgun.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 2h-ranged-_Shotgun.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"128\" src=\"/images/recovered/2h-ranged-_Shotgun.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Boomstick\" title=\"Boomstick\">Boomstick</a>\n</td><td>Two-Handed Ranged\n</td><td>Slashing\n</td><td>Grandma\n</td><td>Unique Only\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2h-ranged-_CR4P_Assault_Rifle.png\" title=\"Image: 2h-ranged-_CR4P_Assault_Rifle_.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 2h-ranged-_CR4P_Assault_Rifle_.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"128\" src=\"/images/recovered/2h-ranged-_CR4P_Assault_Rifle.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/CR4P_Assault_Rifle\" title=\"CR4P Assault Rifle\">CR4P Assault Rifle</a>\n</td><td>Two-Handed Ranged\n</td><td>Slashing\n</td><td>Freakin' Fast\n</td><td>Unique Only\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2h-ranged-_Crystal_Launcher.png\" title=\"Image: 2h-ranged-_Crystal_Launcher_.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 2h-ranged-_Crystal_Launcher_.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"96\" src=\"/images/recovered/2h-ranged-_Crystal_Launcher.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Crystal_Launcher\" title=\"Crystal Launcher\">Crystal Launcher</a>\n</td><td>Two-Handed Ranged\n</td><td>Piercing\n</td><td>Slothful\n</td><td>Unique Only\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2h-ranged-_Fuel_Injected_Crossbow.png\" title=\"Image: 2h-ranged-_Fuel_Injected_Crossbow.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 2h-ranged-_Fuel_Injected_Crossbow.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"96\" src=\"/images/recovered/2h-ranged-_Fuel_Injected_Crossbow.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Fuel_Injected_Crossbow\" title=\"Fuel Injected Crossbow\">Fuel Injected Crossbow</a>\n</td><td>Two-Handed Ranged\n</td><td>Piercing\n</td><td>Fast\n</td><td>\u00a0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2h-ranged-_Gothic_Crossbow.png\" title=\"Image: 2h-ranged-_Gothic_Crossbow.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 2h-ranged-_Gothic_Crossbow.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"96\" src=\"/images/recovered/2h-ranged-_Gothic_Crossbow.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Gothic_Crossbow\" title=\"Gothic Crossbow\">Gothic Crossbow</a>\n</td><td>Two-Handed Ranged\n</td><td>Piercing\n</td><td>Normal\n</td><td>\u00a0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2h-ranged-_Grease_Gun.png\" title=\"Image: 2h-ranged-_Grease_Gun_.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 2h-ranged-_Grease_Gun_.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"128\" src=\"/images/recovered/2h-ranged-_Grease_Gun.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Grease_Gun\" title=\"Grease Gun\">Grease Gun</a>\n</td><td>Two-Handed Ranged\n</td><td>Slashing\n</td><td>Ludicrous\n</td><td>Unique Only\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2h-ranged-_Hunting